ld have used the same stupid picture  for any royal birth or Boris Johnson kid  or even one of my own  it's a funny image a funny image  though not of course in that context  enormous mistake for sure for a desk  anyway here's to your Archie Sorry mate  so Danny Baker are clearly apologetic  deeply regretting what he did but  insisting he just didn't realized the  racist connotations of that tweet
 

